  "title": "Toyota Updates 2027 Sequoia with Elevated Style, Advanced Technology and Newly Available Trailhunter Package",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas (July 23, 2026) — Toyota is enhancing Sequoia for 2027, bringing a fresh new look, advanced technology and expanded capability to better serve active families and adventure-minded customers. Sharing the same spirit of toughness and authenticity that defines Toyota’s truck lineup, the updated Sequoia brings a more refined and confident presence to the full-size SUV segment while reinforcing the versatility that makes it uniquely suited to both everyday driving and outdoor exploration.",
